                "message": "✨ Keep organisation authors whole and match BibTeX accents in fix-authors\n\n- Names such as `The editors` or `Mute Collective` are no longer turned into\n  `Last, First`; they are flagged, and you mark them as organisations (extra\n  braces) or persons, in batches or with `o`/`P` in the report.\n- Confirmed names are remembered in `sp-bibtex-organisations-file`.\n- Other author steps leave names in braces alone.\n- BibTeX accents (`C{\\'e}sar Bola{\\~n}o`) are decoded when matching author\n  notes; the field keeps its escapes unless `sp-bibtex-names-unicode` is set.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBFBRHmoAuFaTY7mup",
